-- 655_fall_halloween_theme_refill: sub-themes the 654 cleanup left under 8 rows get new ones back to about 10. A draw
-- picks one of the holiday's main pools at equal odds and then any row in it (pickHoliday), so a gutted sub-theme just
-- drops out of its pool's mix (solo fall harvest_moonrise_foliage_lake went 14 -> 1 of sky_and_light's rows); the
-- refill keeps each pool's spread of sub-themes. After 654 every cast main pool still had 50+ rows (largest drop 29%),
-- the Oct 31 pool 149 couple / 145 solo. scripts/fill-holiday-themes.js wrote each theme in its own format
-- (couples "She in ..., he in ...", solos one person's outfit with the gender set, scenes with no people), with the
-- theme's live AND removed rows as do-not-repeat and a duplicate read against them. All 110 read by hand: 14 dropped
-- (Día de Muertos marigolds, charro suits and sombreros written onto haunted-house, rooftop and graveyard themes: the
-- theme's own drift and a real culture's dress), 1 theme redone (its rows had lost the lake), 2 fixed (a man's
-- "blouse" -> shirt, a typo). 96 rows; 25 sub-themes end at 8-10.

